1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:04,440
(Sheldon:)These four walls
once housed an intellectual salon...

2
00:00:04,608 --> 00:00:07,818
(Sheldon:)...where the mind received
nourishment as well as the stomach.

3
00:00:07,986 --> 00:00:10,986
But through no one's fauIt, Penny...

4
00:00:12,491 --> 00:00:16,161
(Sheldon:)...the quality of dinner conversation
in this apartment has declined.

5
00:00:16,328 --> 00:00:19,958
(Sheldon:)And again, I'm looking at no one
in particular, Penny.

6
00:00:21,541 --> 00:00:24,211
Fine. What would you Iike
to talk about, Sheldon?

7
00:00:24,419 --> 00:00:26,549
Ugh. "What would you like to talk about,
Sheldon?"

8
00:00:26,713 --> 00:00:28,543
(Howard:)Why do you hate us?

9
00:00:29,299 --> 00:00:31,839
(Sheldon:)I've prepared a number of topics
that should appeal...

10
00:00:32,010 --> 00:00:35,550
(Sheldon:)...to both the advanced
and novice conversationalists.

11
00:00:35,722 --> 00:00:37,432
(Penny:)Okay, that time, you looked at me.

12
00:00:38,683 --> 00:00:43,143
(Amy:)Who didn't? Your skin is like alabaster.
Do you even have pores?

13
00:00:45,023 --> 00:00:48,363
Topic one:
"Faster-than-light particles at CERN:

14
00:00:48,527 --> 00:00:50,197
(Sheldon:)Paradigm-shifting discovery...

15
00:00:50,362 --> 00:00:54,072
(Sheldon:)...or another Swiss export
as full of holes as their cheese?"

16
00:00:54,241 --> 00:00:56,161
(Sheldon:)And converse.

17
00:00:58,078 --> 00:01:00,618
- Who wants to look at bridal magazines?
- Oh, me.

18
00:01:00,789 --> 00:01:03,209
Through no one's fauIt, Sheldon,
we're leaving.

19
00:01:05,210 --> 00:01:08,170
- Wait for moi.
- What? You're leaving?

20
00:01:08,338 --> 00:01:11,758
(Amy:)Sheldon, sometimes you forget,
I'm a Lady.

21
00:01:11,967 --> 00:01:14,097
(Amy:)And with that
comes an estrogen-fueled need...

22
00:01:14,261 --> 00:01:18,011
...to page through glossy magazines
that make me hate my body.

23
00:01:21,560 --> 00:01:23,060
(Sheldon:)- Well.
- New topic:

24
00:01:23,228 --> 00:01:27,568
"Women: Delightfully mysterious
or bat-crap crazy?"

25
00:01:28,233 --> 00:01:30,233
(Raj:)Totally.
What's wrong with cap sleeves?

26
00:01:30,402 --> 00:01:38,032
(Raj:)If you have the right figure for it,
they're adorable.

